pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
elements:
  - elementId: eyebrow
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 36, 500, 16]
    content:
      style: "$eyebrow"
      wrap: false
      text: 核心能力 3 · 双碳核算
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 58, 832, 42]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      wrap: false
      text: 碳排放核算：因子版本化，账目永不漂移
  - elementId: headrule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 110, 832, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: bign
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 132, 260, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 44
      bold: true
      color: "$teal"
      wrap: false
      text: "486.2"
  - elementId: bignu
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 196, 260, 22]
    content: {fontSize: 13, color: "$steel", wrap: false, text: tCO₂e 净排放（2026 年至今 · 示例）}
  - elementId: target
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 236, 260, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$steel"
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: |
        <p><strong>2030 目标进度 68.9%</strong></p>
        <p>强度 -18%（基准年 2024），已实现 -12.4%，距目标 5.6pp（示例）</p>
  - elementId: vrail
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [356, 132, 1, 300]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: f1t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [388, 130, 508, 22]
    content: {fontSize: 14, bold: true, color: "$ink", wrap: false, text: 碳账怎么算}
  - elementId: f1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [388, 158, 508, 90]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p>EmCarbonAccount = 台账 × 排放因子，可无损重算；</p>
        <p>Scope 1（直接燃烧）/ Scope 2（外购电热）/ Scope 3（显式标注因子）分别归集；折标煤合计一屏呈现，未配置系数的介质明示“未计入”而不是静默丢弃。</p>
  - elementId: f2t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [388, 252, 508, 22]
    content: {fontSize: 14, bold: true, color: "$ink", wrap: false, text: 因子版本化}
  - elementId: f2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [388, 280, 508, 70]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: 每条排放因子必填来源文件 emSourceDoc；因子换版即锁定旧版快照，历史账目不漂移、全量可重算；因子单位分母与台账单位不一致时直接报错，拒绝“悄悄错 1000 倍”。
  - elementId: f3t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [388, 354, 508, 22]
    content: {fontSize: 14, bold: true, color: "$ink", wrap: false, text: 绿电 / 绿证抵消}
  - elementId: f3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [388, 382, 508, 50]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: EmGreenCert 仅“已注销核销（emRetired）”的绿证方可计入抵消，未注销证书自动排除，防止重复计算环境权益。
  - elementId: footnote
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 496, 832, 16]
    content:
      style: "$note"
      wrap: false
      text: 对应产品屏：碳排与双碳目标（因子版本表 · 绿证核销 · 月度碳排趋势 · 碳目标进度）
